<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - SG Enterprises - 165,000 tonnes coal Gladstone/Fos 5/20 Aug $8.95 fio 2.5 days shinc/four days shinc P and O.</p>
<p>Pan Ocean TBN - 56,000/5 Hay Point/Annaba 11/15 July $15.35 fio CNAN.</p>
<p>ORE - HMM TBN - 170,000/10 Tubarao/Pohang 25 July/8 Aug $10.29 fio seven days shinc Posco.</p>
<p>TBN - 50,000/10 Puerto Ordaz and Boca Grande/Bourgas 20/30 July $13 fio 60 hours-40,000 shinc/8,500 shinc D'Amato.</p>
</text>
